                   obo:IAO_0000115 "x vertebra_number N if and only if (i) x is a vertebra, and (ii) x is vertebra number N in a series of vertebras repeated along an anterior-posterior axis, with vertebra_number 1 being the anteriormost vertebra (also known as the atlas)." ;
                   obo:UBPROP_0000100 obo:UBERON_0002412 ;
