                   obo:IAO_0000115 "x paired_appendage_number N if and only if (i) x is a paired_appendage, and (ii) x is paired_appendage number N in a series of paired_appendages repeated along an anterior-posterior axis, with paired_appendage_number 1 being the anteriormost paired_appendage. In vertebrates, this is the pectoral appendage." ;
                   obo:UBPROP_0000100 obo:UBERON_0000026 ;
                   obo:UBPROP_0000101 obo:BSPO_0000096 ;
