   oboInOwl:source "DOI:10.1007/s00359-008-0327-1 Schoffelen RLM, Segenhout JM, Van Dijk P, Mechanics of the exceptional anuran ear. Journal of Comparative Physiology A (2008)" ,
                   "http://bgee.unil.ch/"
 ] .

