                   rdfs:subClassOf obo:UBERON_0000475 ;
                   obo:IAO_0000115 "A section of the arthropod leg." ;
                   obo:IAO_0000116 "this term should be ceded to the arthropod anatomy ontology." ;
                   obo:UBPROP_0000008 "homology of leg segments between groups are difficult to prove and are the source of much argument. Some authors posit up to eleven segments per leg for the most recent common ancestor of extant arthropods, but modern arthropods have eight or fewer." ;
