                   owl:disjointWith obo:UBERON_0011106 ;
                   obo:IAO_0000115 "One of a pair of ligaments arranged like a letter X.[1] They occur in several joints of the body, such as the knee. In a fashion similar to the cords in a toy Jacob's ladder, the crossed ligaments stabilize the joint while allowing a very large range of motion[WP]." ;
