                   rdfs:subClassOf obo:UBERON_0014892 ;
                   obo:IAO_0000115 "A muscle that moves a body part away from the sagittal plane/midline of the body[ZFA]. For example, the abductor muscles of the legs spread the legs away from the midline and away from one another. An abductor muscle opposes an adductor muscle[BTO]." ;
