                                     owl:someValuesFrom obo:UBERON_0000023
                                   ] ;
                   obo:IAO_0000115 "A membranous extension of skin that forms the wing material in animals such as bats. It typically comprises a number of patagial segments, stretching from the side of the body between the forelimb digits and sometimes the hindlimbs." ;
