obo:UBERON_0013110 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf obo:UBERON_0013076 ;
                   obo:IAO_0000115 "Venoms of sea snakes, Hydrophiinae, found around Pacific islands. The venoms contain fewer enzymes and more neuro- or myotoxins than land snakes. The neurotoxic proteins are similar to elapid small, short, or type I neurotoxins, some of which have been characterized." ;
